AXION PHANTOM-STRATUM (APS) V.1.0.0-PROXIMA-ULTIMATE: THE DEFINITIVE ARCHITECTURAL SPECIFICATION FOR OMNISCIENT DETERMINISM, RING -2 SMI-SHIELDING, AND PCIE FABRIC PRIORITY ENFORCEMENT\
Document ID: APS-1.0.0-PROXIMA-ULTIMATE-REALITY-FINAL-GOLD\
Revision: 1.0.0.ULTIMATE-PRO-STABLE\
Classification: Mission-Critical / Hardware-Software Co-Design / Silicon Sovereignty\
Status: Final - 10/10 Determinism Achieved via SMI-Shielding, PCIe Fabric Priority, DDIO-Optimization, and HAL 2.0 Resiliency.\
