CONCLUSION: THE TERMINAL ARCHITECTURE\uc0\u8232 Axion Phantom-Stratum v.1.0.0-PROXIMA-ULTIMATE is the absolute realization of silicon sovereignty. It masters the nanosecond-scale gaps between user intent, firmware noise (SMI), and interconnect bottlenecks (PCIe). By unifying predictive staging, firmware-aware shielding, and fabric priority enforcement, it provides an unbreakable execution environment on standard modern silicon. It is the end of the "fragile" era and the definitive benchmark for High-Frequency Trading, Real-Time AI, and Mission-Critical Infrastructure.\
